    "detailed_description": "Nooch Farm is a relaxing/colourful Puzzle game with a fun choice based story!<br />\r\nOrganise the food on the farm into rows, use your smarts to figure out the combinations!<br />\r\nTalk to the animals, get to know their hopes and dreams and discover the motivations behind the resident in Nooch Farm<br />\r\nYour choices matter as the game has multiple endings!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGame features:<br />\r\nAddicting puzzle gameplay<br />\r\nDialogue trees with choices that impact the story<br />\r\nfully voiced narrative<br />\r\nShort but sweet!",
